\(y=x+5\\). Calcula el área de este recinto."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[f(-2)=-1+4=3,\\qquad f'(x)=-\\frac x2\\Rightarrow f'(-2)=1,\\qquad y-3=1\\cdot(x+2)\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=x+5\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La recta \\(y=x+5\\) es la tangente del apartado a): toca a \\(f\\) en \\((-2,3)\\). Cortes:</p><p>• \\(f=g\\): \\(-\\frac{x^2}4+4=x^2-1\\iff x^2=4\\iff x=\\pm2\\): \\((-2,3)\\) y \\((2,3)\\).</p><p>• \\(g\\) con la recta: \\(x^2-1=x+5\\iff x^2-x-6=0\\iff x=-2\\) o \\(x=3\\): \\((-2,3)\\) y \\((3,8)\\).</p><p>El recinto tiene la recta por arriba; por abajo, \\(f\\) entre \\(-2\\) y \\(2\\) y \\(g\\) entre \\(2\\) y \\(3\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='64.6,128.6 66.9,127.4 69.2,126.3 71.5,125.2 73.9,124.0 76.2,122.9 78.5,121.8 80.8,120.7 83.1,119.5 85.5,118.4 87.8,117.3 90.1,116.1 92.4,115.0 94.8,113.9 97.1,112.7 99.4,111.6 101.7,110.5 104.0,109.3 106.4,108.2 108.7,107.1 111.0,106.0 113.3,104.8 115.6,103.7 118.0,102.6 120.3,101.4 122.6,100.3 124.9,99.2 127.3,98.0 129.6,96.9 131.9,95.8 134.2,94.6 136.5,93.5 138.9,92.4 141.2,91.2 143.5,90.1 145.8,89.0 148.1,87.9 150.5,86.7 152.8,85.6 155.1,84.5 157.4,83.3 159.8,82.2 162.1,81.1 164.4,79.9 166.7,78.8 169.0,77.7 171.4,76.5 173.7,75.4 176.0,74.3 178.3,73.2 180.6,72.0 183.0,70.9 185.3,69.8 187.6,68.6 189.9,67.5 192.2,66.4 194.6,65.2 196.9,64.1 199.2,63.0 201.5,61.8 203.9,60.7 206.2,59.6 208.5,58.5 210.8,57.3 213.1,56.2 215.5,55.1 217.8,53.9 220.1,52.8 222.4,51.7 224.8,50.5 227.1,49.4 229.4,48.3 231.7,47.1 234.0,46.0 236.4,44.9 238.7,43.8 241.0,42.6 243.3,41.5 245.6,40.4 248.0,39.2 250.3,38.1 250.3,38.1 248.0,44.8 245.6,51.4 243.3,57.8 241.0,64.1 238.7,70.3 236.4,76.3 234.0,82.1 231.7,87.9 229.4,93.4 227.1,98.9 224.8,104.2 222.4,109.3 220.1,114.4 217.8,119.2 215.5,124.0 213.1,128.6 210.8,